    <string name="mcp_tunnel_title">claude.ai in a browser needs a public address</string>
    <string name="mcp_tunnel_text">claude.ai calls the connector from Anthropic\'s servers, so a tunnel is required. Run in the terminal:\n\npkg install cloudflared\ncloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:%1$d\n\nIt prints an address like https://….trycloudflare.com. In claude.ai open Settings → Connectors → Add custom connector and enter that address followed by %2$s. The address contains a secret — do not share it.</string>
